2.2. Schro ̈dinger Bridge (SB)
SB (Schr ̈odinger, 1932; L ́eonard, 2013) is an entropyregularized optimal transport model that considers the following forward and backward SDEs:
dXt = [ft + βt ∇ logΨ(Xt, t)]dt + pβtdWt, (5a)
