6. Conclusion
We developed I2SB, a new conditional diffusion model that transport between clean and degraded image distributions based on a tractable class of Schro ̈dinger bridge. I2SB yields interpretable generation, enjoys sampling efficiency, and sets new records on image restoration. It will be interesting to combine I2SB with inverse problem techniques.
