B. Introduction to Schr ̈odinger Bridge
The Schro ̈dinger bridge problem was originally introduced quantum mechanics (Schr ̈odinger, 1931; 1932) and later draws broader interests with its connection to optimal transport (L ́eonard, 2013; Dai Pra, 1991). The dynamic Schro ̈dinger bridge (Pavon & Wakolbinger, 1991; Le ́onard, 2012) is typically defined as
